## TileEntity 注册

```java
// TileEntity.register(name, class) — 在 mods 启动时调用
public static void registerTileEntities() {
    GameRegistry.registerTileEntity(MyTileEntity.class,
        new ResourceLocation(MOD_ID, "my_tile"));
}

// 或在 RegistryEvent.Register<TileEntity> 中
@SubscribeEvent
public static void registerTE(RegistryEvent.Register<TileEntity> event) {
    event.getRegistry().register(
        new TileEntity(myTEClass, new ResourceLocation(MOD_ID, "my_tile"))
    );
}
```

